# Lines to add to the VM's crontab (crontab -e). Do NOT replace the existing entries: the amazon-sp-api-ingest
# weekly jobs (Thursday 06:00 and 07:00 UTC) live in the same crontab.
#
# The VM runs in UTC. Each market runs on days 6 to 12 of each month. The ingest asks Amazon for the previous
# month only after day 5, so the closed month normally arrives with the first Thursday ingest that falls on days
# 6 to 12. Until it is in the database the script exits quietly (code 3) and the next day tries again; once the
# month has loaded it does nothing more for that market. If a market has not loaded by day 12 there is no retry
# until next month: on day 13 check that logs/.done_<POOL>_<yyyymm> exists for every market (docs/runbook.md).
#
# One market per line, one hour apart, because run_monthly.sh holds a single lock for all markets: a market that
# finds the lock held exits 1 and only tries again the next day.
# Every line passes SETTINGS so the scheduled job runs the replenish method (without it the script would use
# config/forecast_settings.json, the older seasonal method).
#
# Adjust the folder if the repository is cloned somewhere else.
0 10 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=US SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
0 11 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=UK SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
0 12 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=DE SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
0 13 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=ES SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
0 14 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=FR SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
0 15 6-12 * * cd /home/agentuser/Samir_Daylight/agents/amazon-demand-planning && mkdir -p logs && POOL=IT SETTINGS=config/forecast_settings.replenish.json ./scripts/run_monthly.sh >> logs/cron.log 2>&1
